WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.207
Today we will reuse materials while arranging an image. Our work connects with our

00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:06.280
own local community.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:10.679
Sort clean paper by colour and select pieces for your picture.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:14.413
Arrange pieces on cardboard before applying glue.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.200
Stick the pieces down and explain the main image.
